{#
  One module's mail triage screen (issue #462, D9) — the same component for
  camps and for rentals, so the two screens cannot drift apart the day
  after they were separated.

  The list is `Api\TriageList`'s; what differs between modules is only what
  their objects are called, where their actions post and how one of their
  objects is picked, all of it in `triage_ui`. The component invents no
  access: every row comes from `InboundMailInterface::findForTriage()` with
  the references the consumer says its user may reach, and every form posts
  to the consumer's own controller, which checks them again.

  Requires the output of `TriageList::screen()` (`messages`, `status`,
  `counts`, `include_bulk`, `bulk_count`) and `triage_ui`:

    has_inbound_mail   -- false: no box is read at all, and the screen says so
    filter_url         -- the page's own URL, the filters' base ('' = this page)
    urls               -- {reanalyze, attach, detach, dismiss, restore,
                          confirm, reject}; `{id}` stands for the message id
    hidden             -- name => value, carried by every form (a page's own
                          context: an asset, a booking)
    list_name          -- « des camps », « des locations »: whose list this is
    noun_from          -- « du séjour », « de la réservation »
    attach_other       -- « Rattacher à un autre séjour », the folded picker
    attach_also        -- « Rattacher aussi à un autre séjour », once filed
    labels             -- reference => how a person names that object
    reference_urls     -- reference => the object's own page
    picker_template    -- renders the attach control for one `row`
    row_extra_template -- optional, another gesture after the picker

  « Lire le message » opens ONE dialog, `triage_dialog.html.twig`, which the
  page includes once — outside any region it re-renders in place, since a
  dialog replaced while open is a dialog that closes under the reader.
#}
{% set ui = triage_ui %}
{% macro hidden_fields(ui, message_id) %}
    {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
    <input type="hidden" name="message_id" value="{{ message_id }}">
    {% for name, value in ui.hidden|default({}) %}
        <input type="hidden" name="{{ name }}" value="{{ value }}">
    {% endfor %}
{% endmacro %}
{% import _self as triage %}

<div data-mail-triage>
{% if ui.has_inbound_mail %}
    {# « Relancer l'analyse » — the site's knowledge moves and the mail
       already collected does not follow it. Shown even with nothing to
       triage: « rien ne remonte » is a question asked on an empty screen
       too, and a button that appears only when it has work looks broken
       exactly then. #}
    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2 mb-3">
        {# Unattached first, and by default: what somebody comes here to do
           is decide about the mail nobody could attribute. Counts on the
           tabs: « rien à trier » and « le filtre cache tout » look
           identical on an empty list. « Écartés » only once there is
           something in it, or while it is the filter being read. #}
        {% set filters = {
            'non_rattaches': 'À trier',
            'rattaches': 'Rattachés',
            'tous': 'Tous',
        } %}
        {% if counts.ecartes > 0 or status == 'ecartes' %}
            {% set filters = filters|merge({ 'ecartes': 'Écartés' }) %}
        {% endif %}
        <ul class="nav nav-pills gap-1 mb-0" aria-label="Filtrer le courrier">
            {% for key, label in filters %}
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <a class="nav-link{{ status == key ? ' active' : '' }}"
                       href="{{ ui.filter_url|default('') }}?statut={{ key }}{{ include_bulk ? '&automatique=1' : '' }}"
                       {{ status == key ? 'aria-current="page"' : '' }}>
                        {{ label }}
                        <span class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-{{ status == key ? 'light' : 'secondary' }}">
                            {{ counts[key] }}
                        </span>
                    </a>
                </li>
            {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        <form method="post" action="{{ ui.urls.reanalyze }}">
            {{ triage.hidden_fields(ui, 0) }}
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary"
                    title="Réexamine les messages qui ne sont rattachés à rien, avec ce que le site sait aujourd'hui. Rien n'est jamais détaché, et une proposition écartée le reste.">
                <i class="bi bi-arrow-clockwise" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                Relancer l'analyse
            </button>
        </form>
    </div>
{% endif %}

{% if not ui.has_inbound_mail %}
    {% include 'partials/empty_state.html.twig' with {
        message: 'Aucune boîte n\'est relevée par le site : rien n\'arrive ici. Un administrateur peut en raccorder une dans la configuration du module Courrier entrant.',
        icon: 'bi-envelope',
    } only %}
{% elseif messages is empty %}
    {% include 'partials/empty_state.html.twig' with {
        message: status == 'ecartes'
            ? 'Aucun courrier écarté.'
            : (counts.tous > 0
                ? 'Aucun message dans ce filtre. Les autres sont sous les onglets ci-dessus.'
                : 'Aucun message à trier.'),
        icon: 'bi-envelope-check',
    } only %}
{% else %}
    <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-3">
        {% for row in messages %}
            <div class="card" data-triage-message="{{ row.message.id }}">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start gap-2 flex-wrap">
                        <div class="min-w-0">
                            <div class="fw-semibold">{{ row.message.subject ?: 'Sans objet' }}</div>
                            <div class="small text-body-secondary">{{ row.message.displayFrom() }}</div>
                        </div>
                        <span class="small text-body-secondary text-nowrap">
                            {{ row.message.sentAt|date_fr }}
                            {% if row.message.isBulk %}<span class="badge text-bg-light">automatique</span>{% endif %}
                        </span>
                    </div>

                    {% if row.has_body %}
                        {# One truncated line, and the whole message in a
                           dialog. The body is rendered HERE, hidden, and
                           MOVED into the dialog on opening
                           (mail-message-dialog.js): no HTML string travels
                           through an attribute or innerHTML. #}
                        <div class="small text-body-secondary text-truncate mt-2">{{ row.excerpt }}</div>
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-link btn-sm p-0 mt-1"
                                data-mail-message-open="mail-message-body-{{ row.message.id }}"
                                data-mail-message-title="{{ row.message.subject ?: 'Sans objet' }}"
                                data-mail-message-meta="{{ row.message.displayFrom() }} · {{ row.message.sentAt|datetime_fr }}">
                            <i class="bi bi-envelope-open" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            Lire le message
                        </button>
                        <div class="d-none mail-message-body" id="mail-message-body-{{ row.message.id }}">
                            {% include '@inbound_mail/partials/message_body.html.twig' with { message: row.message } only %}
                        </div>
                    {% endif %}

                    {% if row.message.hasAttachments or row.message.hasOmittedAttachments %}
                        {# Openable from the card: a document is decided about
                           by reading it, not by counting it. #}
                        <div class="mt-2">
                            {% include '@inbound_mail/partials/attachments.html.twig' with { message: row.message, downloadable: true } only %}
                        </div>
                    {% endif %}

                    {% if status == 'ecartes' %}
                        {# Nothing to decide about a message that was set aside
                           except whether to take it back. #}
                        <form method="post" class="mt-3" action="{{ ui.urls.restore|replace({'{id}': row.message.id}) }}">
                            {{ triage.hidden_fields(ui, row.message.id) }}
                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm">
                                <i class="bi bi-arrow-counterclockwise" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                Remettre dans la liste
                            </button>
                        </form>
                    {% else %}
                        {# What THIS module made of it and nothing else:
                           another module's associations are not this
                           screen's business. How each link was made is
                           shown: a reference in the subject is a
                           near-certainty, a sender matched in a time window
                           is a guess. #}
                        {% if row.links is not empty %}
                            <div class="mt-2 d-flex flex-wrap gap-1">
                                {% for link in row.links %}
                                    {% set name = ui.labels[link.businessReference]|default(link.businessReference) %}
                                    {% set url = ui.reference_urls[link.businessReference]|default(null) %}
                                    {% if url %}
                                        <a class="badge text-bg-success text-decoration-none" href="{{ url }}">Rattaché — {{ name }}</a>
                                    {% else %}
                                        <span class="badge text-bg-success">Rattaché — {{ name }}</span>
                                    {% endif %}
                                    {% if not link.origin.isCertain %}
                                        <span class="badge text-bg-warning">Rattachement incertain · {{ link.origin.label }}</span>
                                    {% endif %}
                                {% endfor %}
                            </div>
                        {% endif %}

                        {% if row.candidates is not empty %}
                            <div class="mt-3">
                                <div class="small fw-semibold">Propositions à confirmer</div>
                                <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
                                    {% for candidate in row.candidates %}
                                        <li class="list-group-item px-0 d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2">
                                            <div>
                                                <div>{{ candidate.label }}</div>
                                                <div class="small text-body-secondary">{{ candidate.explanation }}</div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                                                <form method="post" action="{{ ui.urls.confirm|replace({'{id}': row.message.id}) }}">
                                                    {{ triage.hidden_fields(ui, row.message.id) }}
                                                    <input type="hidden" name="candidate_id" value="{{ candidate.id }}">
                                                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Rattacher</button>
                                                </form>
                                                <form method="post" action="{{ ui.urls.reject|replace({'{id}': row.message.id}) }}">
                                                    {{ triage.hidden_fields(ui, row.message.id) }}
                                                    <input type="hidden" name="candidate_id" value="{{ candidate.id }}">
                                                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm">Écarter</button>
                                                </form>
                                            </div>
                                        </li>
                                    {% endfor %}
                                </ul>
                                {% if row.candidates|length > 1 %}
                                    <p class="small text-body-secondary mb-0">
                                        Plusieurs correspondent : le site n'en choisit aucun tant que vous n'avez pas tranché.
                                    </p>
                                {% endif %}
                            </div>
                        {% endif %}

                        {# ONE primary gesture per card. When the module
                           proposed something, or already filed the message,
                           the free picker sits behind a fold, so two
                           « Rattacher » buttons never face anybody at once. #}
                        {% set folded = row.candidates is not empty or row.links is not empty %}
                        {% if folded %}
                        <details class="mt-3">
                            <summary class="btn btn-link btn-sm p-0">
                                {{ row.links is empty ? ui.attach_other : ui.attach_also }}
                            </summary>
                        {% else %}
                        <div class="mt-3">
                        {% endif %}
                            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-end gap-2 mt-2">
                                <form method="post" action="{{ ui.urls.attach|replace({'{id}': row.message.id}) }}"
                                      class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-end gap-2 flex-grow-1">
                                    {{ triage.hidden_fields(ui, row.message.id) }}
                                    <div class="flex-grow-1" style="min-width: 14rem;">
                                        {% include ui.picker_template with { row: row, triage_ui: ui } only %}
                                    </div>
                                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Rattacher</button>
                                </form>
                                {% if ui.row_extra_template|default(null) %}
                                    {% include ui.row_extra_template with { row: row } only %}
                                {% endif %}
                            </div>
                        {% if folded %}
                        </details>
                        {% else %}
                        </div>
                        {% endif %}

                        {% if row.links is not empty %}
                            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-2">
                                {% for link in row.links %}
                                    <form method="post" action="{{ ui.urls.detach|replace({'{id}': row.message.id}) }}"
                                          data-confirm="Détacher ce message {{ ui.noun_from }} ? Il reste dans le courrier de l'unité.">
                                        {{ triage.hidden_fields(ui, row.message.id) }}
                                        <input type="hidden" name="business_reference" value="{{ link.businessReference }}">
                                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm">
                                            Détacher de « {{ ui.labels[link.businessReference]|default(link.businessReference) }} »
                                        </button>
                                    </form>
                                {% endfor %}
                            </div>
                        {% endif %}

                        {# « Ce courrier ne concerne pas ce module » (#174).
                           Offered only on a message this module filed
                           nowhere: one that IS filed leaves the list by being
                           detached. It deletes nothing: the unit's mail still
                           has it, and the retention takes it on exactly the
                           day it would have anyway. #}
                        {% if row.links is empty %}
                            <div class="mt-2">
                                <form method="post" action="{{ ui.urls.dismiss|replace({'{id}': row.message.id}) }}"
                                      data-confirm="Écarter ce courrier de la liste {{ ui.list_name }} ? Il reste dans le courrier de l'unité et vous pourrez le remettre.">
                                    {{ triage.hidden_fields(ui, row.message.id) }}
                                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-link btn-sm p-0 text-body-secondary">
                                        <i class="bi bi-eye-slash" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                        Écarter ce courrier
                                    </button>
                                </form>
                            </div>
                        {% endif %}
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
            </div>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
{% endif %}

{% if ui.has_inbound_mail and bulk_count > 0 %}
    <p class="mt-3 mb-0">
        {% if include_bulk %}
            <a href="{{ ui.filter_url|default('') }}?statut={{ status }}">Masquer le courrier automatique</a>
        {% else %}
            <a href="{{ ui.filter_url|default('') }}?statut={{ status }}&automatique=1">Afficher le courrier automatique ({{ bulk_count }})</a>
        {% endif %}
    </p>
{% endif %}

<p class="text-body-secondary small mt-4">
    Un message que rien ne rattache et sur lequel aucune proposition ne subsiste est
    supprimé automatiquement au terme du délai de conservation réglé pour le courrier
    entrant.
</p>
</div>
